{
  "id": "1KI.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Kho 1",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDavida yayisiluphele kakhulu; loba beyembesa ngezingubo, kayikhudumalanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zayo zasezisithi: Inkosi yethu kayidingelwe intombazana, ukuba iyilondoloze, iyonge, ilale esifubeni sayo ukuba ikhudumale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zasezidinga intombazana enhle elizweni lonke lakoIsrayeli, zazuza uAbishagi waseShunami, zayiletha enkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intombazana yayinhle kakhulu, yaba ngumongi wenkosi, yayilondoloza; kodwa inkosi kayingenanga layo engutsheni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdonija indodana kaHagithi wayezibula esithi: Mina ngizakuba yinkosi. Wasezilungiselela inqola zokulwa labagadi bamabhiza, lamadoda angamatshumi amahlanu ukugijima phambi kwakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 3:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyise wayengazanga amdanise lakanye ngokubuza ukuthi: Ukwenzeleni lokhu na? Futhi uAdonija wayemuhle kakhulu, eselama uAbisalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wacebisana loJowabi indodana kaZeruya loAbiyatha umpristi, bona bamlandela bamsiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uZadoki umpristi, loBenaya indodana kaJehoyada, loNathani umprofethi, loShimeyi loReyi, lamaqhawe kaDavida kabamlandelanga uAdonija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdonija wanikela imihlatshelo yezimvu lezinkabi lamathole anonisiweyo ngaselitsheni laseZohelethi eliseceleni kweEni‐Rogeli, wamema bonke abafowabo, amadodana enkosi, labo bonke abakoJuda abazinceku zenkosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa kabamemanga oNathani umprofethi loBenaya lamaqhawe loSolomoni umfowabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNathani wasesithi kuBathisheba unina kaSolomoni: Kawuzwanga yini ukuthi uAdonija indodana kaHagithi useyinkosi, loDavida inkosi yethu ingakwazi na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke lalela ngikweluleke, ukuze uzisilise wena loSolomoni indodana yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngena masinyane enkosini uDavida uthi kuyo: Wena nkosi yami, kawufunganga yini kuncekukazi yakho ukuthi uSolomoni indodana yami uzabusa emva kwakho, abe yinkosi na? Phoke, kungani uAdonija eseyinkosi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi lapho usakhuluma lenkosi uDavida, ngingene lami ngikulandela, ngelekelele amazwi akho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBathisheba wasesiya enkosini endlini yayo. Yayisiluphele kakhulu, uAbishagi waseShunami wayeyilondoloza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBathisheba wasekhothama ekhuleka enkosini; inkosi yathi: Ufunani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi kuyo: Nkosi yami, wafunga ngeNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho kuncekukazi yakho ukuthi uSolomoni indodana yami uzabusa emva kwakho, abe yinkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa nangu uAdonija useyinkosi, lanxa wena, nkosi yami, ungakwazi lokhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usenikele imihlatshelo yezinkabi lamathole anonisiweyo lezimvu ezinengi, wamema wonke amadodana enkosi loAbiyatha umpristi loJowabi induna yempi; kodwa uSolomoni inceku yakho kammemanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenake, nkosi, bonke abakoIsrayeli bakhangele kuwe ukuba ubatshele ukuthi ngubani ozakuba yinkosi emva kwakho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "funa kuthi lapho inkosi yami isibhubhile, mina lendodana yami uSolomoni sethweswe icala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho esakhuluma lenkosi, kwafika uNathani umprofethi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayibikela inkosi bathi: Nangu uNathani umprofethi. Yena esefikile phambi kwenkosi wathi mbo ngobuso phansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Nkosi yami, utshilo yini ukuthi uAdonija uzabusa emva kwakho, abe yinkosi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba wehlile lamhla, wanikela imihlatshelo yezinkabi lamathole anonisiweyo lezimvu ezinengi, wamema wonke amadodana enkosi, loJowabi induna yempi, loAbiyatha umpristi; bayadla benatha phambi kwakhe, bayamemeza besithi: Bayethe, nkosi Adonija! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa mina nceku yakho loZadoki umpristi loBenaya indodana kaJehoyada lenceku yakho uSolomoni kasimemanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kwenziwe yinkosi yami, kayaze yatshela inceku zayo ukuba ngubani ozakuba yinkosi emva kwayo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDavida yasiphendula isithi: Ngibizelani uBathisheba. Yena wasengena enkosini, wema phambi kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasifunga isithi: Ngifunga iNkosi uNkulunkulu engophule kuzo zonke inhlupheko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "njengoba ngafunga kuwe ngayo iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ngisithi: USolomoni indodana yakho uzabusa emva kwami, abe yinkosi esikhundleni sami; ngiyaphinda futhi lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBathisheba wathi mbo ngobuso phansi, wakhuleka enkosini esithi: Bayethe, nkosi yami uDavida!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDavida yasisithi: Ngibizelani uZadoki umpristi, loNathani umprofethi, loBenaya indodana kaJehoyada. Basebesiza enkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathi kibo: Thathani inceku zami, ligadise uSolomoni indodana yami eyami imbongolo, limuse eGihoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uZadoki umpristi loNathani umprofethi bamgcobe lapho abe yinkosi yakoIsrayeli; beselikhalisa impondo lisithi: Bayethe, nkosi Solomoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beselimlandela, yena uzangena ahlale esihlalweni sami sobukhosi, ngoba uzakuba yinkosi esikhundleni sami, ngimbekile ukuba abe ngumbusi wakoIsrayeli lakoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBenaya indodana kaJehoyada waseyiphendula inkosi esithi: Kakube njalo. Kungathi iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wenkosi yami, ingaqinisa okutshoyo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengoba iNkosi uNkulunkulu ibilawe, kungathi ingaba loSolomoni, iwenze umbuso wakhe ube mkhulu kulowenkosi yami uDavida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uZadoki umpristi, loNathani umprofethi, loBenaya indodana kaJehoyada, lamaKerethi lamaPelethi ayengabalindi, basuka bamgadisa uSolomoni imbongolo yenkosi uDavida, bamusa eGihoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UZadoki umpristi wathatha uphondo lwamafutha ethenteni, wamgcoba uSolomoni. Basebekhalisa uphondo, bonke abantu bamemeza besithi: Bayethe, nkosi Solomoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu basebemlandela, bekhalisa imihlanga bethokoza kakhulu, waze waduma wonke umhlaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdonija labo bonke ababelaye bawuzwa umsindo sebeqeda ukudla. Kwathi lapho uJowabi esizwa ukukhala kophondo wathi: Ngowani umsindo wokuxokozela phakathi komuzi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho esakhuluma, kwafika uJonathani indodana kaAbiyatha umpristi; uAdonija wathi kuye: Ngena, ngoba uyindodana ethembekileyo, ngiyabona usilethele indaba ezinhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJonathani wamphendula uAdonija wathi: Atshi bo, ngoba inkosi yethu uDavida isimbekile uSolomoni waba yinkosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ithume uZadoki umpristi, loNathani umprofethi, loBenaya indodana kaJehoyada, lamaKerethi lamaPelethi ayengabalindi, bamgadisa imbongolo yenkosi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uZadoki umpristi loNathani umprofethi bamgcobile eGihoni waba yinkosi, basuka lapho bethokoza; yikho umuzi uxokozela. Yiwo lowomsindo owuzwileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni usehlezi esihlalweni sobukhosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi inceku zenkosi zifikile ukuyihalalela inkosi yethu uDavida, zisithi: UNkulunkulu wakho alenze ibizo likaSolomoni libe lodumo oludlula olwakho, lombuso wakhe ube mkhulu kulowakho. Inkosi uDavida yakhothama embhedeni wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ithe: Kayibongwe iNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, ebeke indlalifa esihlalweni sami sobukhosi lamuhla ngisekhona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abamenyiweyo bakaAdonija bathuthumela, basuka, kwaba yilowo lalowo wahamba ngendlela yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAdonija wamesaba uSolomoni; ngokwesaba wasuka waya ealtareni, wabamba impondo zalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabikelwa uSolomoni ukuthi: UAdonija uyayesaba inkosi uSolomoni; usebambe impondo zealtare uthi: Inkosi uSolomoni kayifunge kimi kuqala ukuba kayiyikuyibulala inceku yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wathi: Uba eyindoda ethembekileyo, kayikulinyazwa lutho. Kodwa uba kukhona okubi kuye, uzakubhubha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uSolomoni yasithumela ilizwi, bamehlisa ealtareni. Weza wakhuleka enkosini uSolomoni; uSolomoni wathi kuye: Hamba emzini wakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
